Subject: [PATCH] kernel: fix Realtek PHY package dependency for 7.4

The Linux 7.4 Realtek PHY driver uses the generic PHY package module.
Select the 7.4 conditional dependency so phy_package.ko is included.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
@@ -583,1 +583,1 @@
-   DEPENDS:=+kmod-libphy +kmod-hwmon-core +LINUX_7_3:kmod-phy-package
+   DEPENDS:=+kmod-libphy +kmod-hwmon-core +LINUX_7_4:kmod-phy-package
